      // every device. The backfill carries `struct_<ts>_<rnd>` forward verbatim. Re-minting would
      // orphan every spec, condition and OK-state recorded against a secondary building, which is the
      // same permanence rule node ids and photoSlots roles carry.
      //
      // ── THE PRIMARY BUILDING GETS A REAL ROW (owner ruling, option 2) ────────────────
